. Existing reviews address monotherapy, emphasize mechanistic preclinical data, and predate a considerable body of clinical data published between 2021 and 2026. We set out to review the mechanistic, laboratory, and clinical data of ivermectin-mebendazole as adjunctive, combination therapy in patients undergoing conventional cancer care. Methods. PubMed, Europe PMC and Google Scholar were searched through October 2026 for peer-reviewed in vitro, in vivo, and human studies of ivermectin and mebendazole in malignant disease, supplemented by oncology meeting abstracts, reference-list screening of prior reviews and ClinicalTrials.gov records. Mechanisms were counted at the level of distinct molecular ta", "title": "Combination Ivermectin and Mebendazole: A Comprehensive Review of Anticancer Mechanisms, Preclinical Activity, and Clinical Evidence as Adjunctive Treatment in Cancer Patients"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2112585029196877998", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjfKivZ", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 67, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "illegal", "id": 8896881, "raw_content": "", "author": "5121313", "created": 1792531159439, "profile_picture": "zPB4r5jzErAy", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SmokeDopeDank", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjfKivZ.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/EricLDaugh/status/2112585029196877998", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "AAG Harmeet Dhillon & DOJ Just Made Instacart Pay $5 MIL for Rigging Its Hiring Process Against American Workers in favor of FOREIGN VISA HOLDERS. EVERY Company is now Officially on Notice! Americans Applying for these Jobs had